    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a low-fat mayo prototype and the emulsion is breaking pretty quick when we drop the pH. could you explain the molecular mechanism of how lecithin stabilizes the interface, specifically in high-acid environments?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
